# 行尾规范：所有文本文件在仓库中一律 LF 存储，检出统一为 LF，
# 彻底消除 Windows 上 core.autocrlf 反复刷出的 LF→CRLF 警告。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属脚本：检出 CRLF（个别 Windows 工具对 LF 兼容差）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产：绝不做任何行尾/编码转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.epub binary
*.docx binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
